{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All aboard for chaos on the tracks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this on-the-rails take on tower defense, build your railroad through monster-infested lands, load up your train with specialized wagons, and fight to keep the line open while delivering passengers and cargo for firepower and profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic planning meets frantic survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wave and every run gives you new choices of wagons and upgrades, unlocked through a growing deck of cards. Will you add heavy cannons, support cars, or storage to push for bigger profits? Adapt your train to the threats ahead and keep moving!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your track:</strong> Plan and place railroads through the lands, shaping your route to maximize survival and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your train:</strong> Draw cards to add wagons, weapons, and upgrades, creating a well-oiled machine of bullets and bank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight the horde:</strong> Defend your locomotive against waves of monsters determined to stop your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver and profit:</strong> Transport passengers and cargo to earn money for upgrades and expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your engine:</strong> Strengthen your locomotive to survive longer runs and tougher enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art mayhem:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy a handcrafted 2D style </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choo Choo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prioritize defense, economy, or sheer firepower, the right combination of tracks and wagons is the difference between a successful trip and a smoking wreck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your train rolling through t